<title>TURKEY: Turkish military plane crashes, three injured.</title>
<headline>Turkish military plane crashes, three injured.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Turkish military plane crashed in western Turkey on Wednesday, injuring three military personnel, Anatolian news agency reported.</p>
<p>It said the plane, the type of which was not  identified, crashed into a hill near the popular Aegean Sea holiday resort of Kusadasi around midday (0900 GMT).</p>
<p>The crash occured during a training flight and its cause was unknown, the agency said.</p>
